            "body": ">Try this one with cursor on `3`: `( 1 ( 2 ( 3 ) 4 ) 5 )`\r\n\r\nYap, I figured it out and edited my comment I missed a space in my testing :-)\r\n\r\n> `'^(.%s+).-(%s+.)$'`\r\n\r\nWorks great indeed, though I'm not sure if it's worth the bother due to the above, I'll run it for a while and see how I like it, I can always use `)` for the balanced pair counteraprt.",
