            "body": "> The tag surrounding should work in latest `main` branch. Thanks again for noticing this!\r\n\r\nThank you @echasnovski, works great!\r\n\r\nBtw, I replaced `indent-blankline` with your `indentscope` in [my config](https://github.com/ibhagwan/nvim-lua), your attention to details and perfectionism is admirable - only shows me the relevant scope, column-scope awareness, all perfectly matching the text-objects (I use it for visual mode select) and the animaton just makes it the perfect indent plugin IMO.",
