        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "#103 is now resolved after recent updates to `main`. Open brackets now by default include all whitespace into surrounding.\r\n\r\nAlso, @ibhagwan, format of input surrounding is now soft deprecated in favor of format used in 'mini.ai'. It now has some special meaning to `x.-y` pattern: it now selects *the smallest matched* span possible which is a more symmetric approach regarding search logic. But its downside is that it doesn't really work with with nested matched patterns: in case of `* (  ()  )` with cursor at `*` it will only match inner `()` and not surrounding of `(  ()` (because it is a match with not the smallest width).\r\n\r\nAll in all, I think new default values are more what people normally need.",
            "created_at": "2022-08-28T08:10:13Z",
